Subject: [PATCH] feat(core): add IsolationLevel enum for transaction isolation
 levels

Maps DEFAULT, READ_UNCOMMITTED, READ_COMMITTED, REPEATABLE_READ and
SERIALIZABLE to their Spring/JDBC integer values, with a cached
from(int) lookup that falls back to DEFAULT, for the transaction
diagnostics model (#506).

Closes #524
